		<text>Compact Header</text>
	</string>
	<string id="ui_mcm_dogma_weapon_tooltip_compact_header_desc">
		<text>Put weight just under the item name (left) and pull the description / STATUS block up to reclaim the empty padding. Applies to all item tooltips.</text>
	</string>
