	<string id="ui_mcm_dogma_weapon_tooltip_use_condition_table">
		<text>Damage table uses barrel condition</text>
	</string>
	<string id="ui_mcm_dogma_weapon_tooltip_use_condition_table_desc">
		<text>Off assumes a perfect barrel (live WPO barrel part when on).</text>
	</string>
	<string id="ui_mcm_dogma_weapon_tooltip_apply_silencer_table">
		<text>Table uses silencer boost</text>
	</string>
	<string id="ui_mcm_dogma_weapon_tooltip_apply_silencer_table_desc">
		<text>When a silencer is equipped: x1.07 on stalker damage/AP in the table (and AP color scale). Mutants never get this.</text>
	</string>
