		<text>Damage stats use barrel condition</text>
	</string>
	<string id="ui_mcm_dogma_weapon_tooltip_use_condition_stats_desc">
		<text>Off assumes a perfect barrel. Affects both Dmg stats.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="ui_mcm_dogma_weapon_tooltip_apply_silencer_stats">
		<text>Stats use silencer</text>
	</string>
	<string id="ui_mcm_dogma_weapon_tooltip_apply_silencer_stats_desc">
		<text>When a silencer is equipped: Dmg vs Stalkers x1.07, Burst Size cam-recoil, and Bullet Drop muzzle-speed. Does not change Barrel Wear. Mutants unaffected.</text>
	</string>
